sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant SIEM as SIEM / Source
  participant ORCH as AgentOrchestrator
  participant NORM as NormalizationPipeline
  participant INTEL as Intelligence Service
  participant POLICY as PolicyEngine
  participant EXEC as ExecutionPipeline
  participant AUDIT as AuditLogger
  participant CASE as CaseManager

  SIEM->>ORCH: RawAlert
  ORCH->>NORM: ProcessAsync(raw)
  NORM-->>ORCH: EnrichedAlert

  ORCH->>INTEL: POST /v1/score
  INTEL-->>ORCH: ThreatAssessment
  ORCH->>INTEL: POST /v1/plan
  INTEL-->>ORCH: DecisionPlan

  ORCH->>POLICY: Evaluate(plan, assessment, alert)
  POLICY-->>ORCH: PolicyDecision

  alt Approved actions exist
    ORCH->>EXEC: ExecuteAsync(...)
    EXEC-->>ORCH: ExecutionReport
  else Only pending/denied
    ORCH-->>ORCH: Skip execution
  end

  ORCH->>AUDIT: Log scoring/planning/policy/execution
  ORCH->>CASE: OpenOrUpdate(...)

  Note over ORCH,EXEC: rollbackActions are prepared and logged, not auto-executed